:"Schema-valid configuration violates architectural constraints.","expected_error":"Runtime instability or security-policy bypass.","cause":"Verification covers syntax but not semantics.","root_cause":"Configuration considered data rather than executable architecture policy.","solution":"Add architecture-level configuration fitness tests.","edge_case":"Two individually valid settings create an invalid combination.","security_implication":"Security-sensitive configuration combinations require explicit negative tests.","performance_implication":"Configuration verification should use bounded representative cases and measured runtime checks where performance is material.","test_case":"Generate a valid schema configuration that violates a cross-field invariant and verify rejection.","test_input":"Retries higher than allowed timeout budget.","expected_test_result":"Configuration fails semantic validation before application.","testing_guidance":"Maintain a constraint matrix and test boundary values plus incompatible combinations.","verification_method":"Configuration fitness tests and controlled runtime verification.","verification_guidance":"Record exactly which configuration combinations and runtime effects were verified.","language":"Python","language_version":"3.x","framework":"","framework_version":"","version_range":"Python 3.x","dependencies":[],"execution_requirements":[],"execution_status":"NOT_EXECUTED","validation_status":"ILLUSTRATIVE","evidence_level":"ARCHITECTURE_VERIFICATION_PATTERN","confidence":0.99,"related_records":["D35-B040-R001","D35-B031-R001","D35-B080-R004"],"depends_on":["D35-B040-R001","D35-B031-R001"],"requires":[],"extends":[],"refines":[],"specializes":[],"contrasts_with":[],"contradicts":[],"supersedes":[],"implements":["D35-B080"],"tests":["D35-B080-R001","D35-B080-R002","D35-B080-R003","D35-B080-R004"],"verifies":["D35-B080-R001","D35-B080-R002","D35-B080-R003","D35-B080-R004"],"derived_from":[],"provenance":["Google SRE change-management 